  nonce: de17  # de17
  message: "CLOSURE EVIDENCE (behavioral, on the merged tree at 3dfb7f7ad4, not the branch). BEFORE: gitleaks detect --source . --no-git --no-banner reported \"leaks found: 4\" (exit 1) and release-check reported 4 failed checks. AFTER: the same gitleaks invocation exits 0 with \"no leaks found\", and release-check reports 2 failed checks -- both of which are the known non-issues, \"Uncommitted changes detected\" (the tracker .ops file that auto-sync owns) and \"Tag v7.0.0 already exists\" (no version bump yet). Its security and lint lines now read \"No secrets detected (gitleaks)\" and \"Linting passed (Ruff)\". POSITIVE CONTROL, because a suppression that cannot be shown to discriminate is indistinguishable from one that suppresses everything: a fresh un-annotated gho_ token appended to tests/test_scrub_secrets.py -- a file whose line 52 IS annotated -- fired at its own line 485, and only there. So the allow is line-scoped, not file-scoped. Also verified: 1617 tests pass with the mypy ratchet clean, and 98 pass across the six edited test files. Merged in PR #418."  # de17
